        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the King outlawed potions, your career as an Alchemist was over in an instant. In a sudden twist of fate, you now run a humble tavern in a world of strange patrons, greedy thieves, and eldritch bargains. Brew powerful drinks, upgrade your establishment, and sign dangerous contracts with the all-seeing Eye. Power comes easily… but every gift carries a price. Sacrifice it all to try and overthrow the tyrant king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE THE RISK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions in the back <strong>secretly</strong> and serve the occult, you will be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/3cb17905e02121bf789a1418cda9b756.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/3cb17905e02121bf789a1418cda9b756.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/3cb17905e02121bf789a1418cda9b756.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling potions can make you rich, but they are illegal in the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to balance risk and reward when trying to make a delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/444d350145e39261ae12dd16a0f48d69.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/444d350145e39261ae12dd16a0f48d69.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/444d350145e39261ae12dd16a0f48d69.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TYRANT KING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King and his men are trying to clean up the kingdom, they will be watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/1bd0d113a772bc7be110c031cd64f4cf.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/1bd0d113a772bc7be110c031cd64f4cf.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/1bd0d113a772bc7be110c031cd64f4cf.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT LEPRECHAUNS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare, mythical creature known to drop powerful upgrades when hit over the head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/a236e7281264aec3e817e747d8129f91.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/a236e7281264aec3e817e747d8129f91.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/a236e7281264aec3e817e747d8129f91.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE EYEBALL ZONE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vael'Rath the unblinking doom <strong>invites</strong> you to his domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking too much power may bring <strong><i>devastation</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/56f1d5f3b9e8fe2d197469851e7844ab.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/56f1d5f3b9e8fe2d197469851e7844ab.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/56f1d5f3b9e8fe2d197469851e7844ab.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 special customers to discover and unlock, many with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tavern to accommodate more customers and serve new menu items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World events and rare customers that can change the direction of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tavern upgrades in between days, or loot upgrades through other means.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character to make each run better than the last!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with the townsfolk and try to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/18584c95364affd0471eb3d0fb12670e.avif?t=1774642475\" width=96 height=96 /></span> </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the King outlawed potions, your career as an Alchemist was over in an instant. In a sudden twist of fate, you now run a humble tavern in a world of strange patrons, greedy thieves, and eldritch bargains. Brew powerful drinks, upgrade your establishment, and sign dangerous contracts with the all-seeing Eye. Power comes easily… but every gift carries a price. Sacrifice it all to try and overthrow the tyrant king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE THE RISK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions in the back <strong>secretly</strong> and serve the occult, you will be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/3cb17905e02121bf789a1418cda9b756.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/3cb17905e02121bf789a1418cda9b756.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/3cb17905e02121bf789a1418cda9b756.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling potions can make you rich, but they are illegal in the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to balance risk and reward when trying to make a delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/444d350145e39261ae12dd16a0f48d69.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/444d350145e39261ae12dd16a0f48d69.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/444d350145e39261ae12dd16a0f48d69.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TYRANT KING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King and his men are trying to clean up the kingdom, they will be watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/1bd0d113a772bc7be110c031cd64f4cf.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/1bd0d113a772bc7be110c031cd64f4cf.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/1bd0d113a772bc7be110c031cd64f4cf.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT LEPRECHAUNS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare, mythical creature known to drop powerful upgrades when hit over the head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/a236e7281264aec3e817e747d8129f91.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/a236e7281264aec3e817e747d8129f91.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/a236e7281264aec3e817e747d8129f91.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE EYEBALL ZONE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vael'Rath the unblinking doom <strong>invites</strong> you to his domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking too much power may bring <strong><i>devastation</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/56f1d5f3b9e8fe2d197469851e7844ab.poster.avif?t=1774642475\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/56f1d5f3b9e8fe2d197469851e7844ab.webm?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/56f1d5f3b9e8fe2d197469851e7844ab.mp4?t=1774642475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 special customers to discover and unlock, many with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your tavern to accommodate more customers and serve new menu items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World events and rare customers that can change the direction of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tavern upgrades in between days, or loot upgrades through other means.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character to make each run better than the last!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with the townsfolk and try to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243410/extras/18584c95364affd0471eb3d0fb12670e.avif?t=1774642475\" width=96 height=96 /></span> </p>",
